|                      | Normal Service     | Headless Service         |
| -------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------ |
| ClusterIP            | Yes                | **None**                 |
| DNS returns          | Service IP         | **Pod IPs**              |
| Load balancing       | Service/kube-proxy | Client/service discovery |
| Direct Pod discovery | No                 | **Yes**                  |
| Common use           | Web apps           | Stateful applications    |
| StatefulSet pairing  | Optional           | **Very common**          |


